{"path":"memory/gc/undeclare_no_pointers","title":"std::undeclare_no_pointers","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>undeclare_no_pointers","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/gc/undeclare_no_pointers","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Unregisters a range earlier registered with std::declare_no_pointers().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/memory\">&lt;memory&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> undeclare_no_pointers<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>p, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> n <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx23\">(removed in C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Unregisters a range earlier registered with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/declare_no_pointers\"><span class=\"kw753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">declare_no_pointers</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> p\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the beginning of the range previously registered with <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/declare_no_pointers\">std::declare_no_pointers</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the number of bytes in the range, same value as previously used with <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/declare_no_pointers\">std::declare_no_pointers</a></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/declare_no_pointers\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>declare_no_pointers</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx23\">(removed in C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  declares that a memory area does not contain traceable pointers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::undeclare_no_pointers","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11, until C++23. Unregisters a range earlier registered with std::declare_no_pointers()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"p, n"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"declare_no_pointers","note":"declares that a memory area does not contain traceable pointers"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++23"],"wordCount":75,"codeBlockCount":0}
